The complete source code for WarpTris 1.0
-----------------------------------------
 WarpTris is a Freeware, 32bit Multi-Threaded Tetris like game 
for OS/2 Warp. Instead of pieces droping from top to bottom
they appear at the middle of the game window, and then start
falling towards on side of it randomly. This enables you to
make lines all around the game window.
 This is the source code for WarpTris!